## Document Coverage - render.vm
## Source: widgets/docCoverage/src/render.vm. tools/build-widget.py inlines the shared snippets (shared/vm) at the
## BW_SHARED markers and shared/js/core.js + graph.js at the BW_INLINE_JS marker, checks the result with
## Velocity 1.4 and writes widgets/docCoverage/dist/docCoverage.zip.
## Velocity 1.4 dialect (guide 3.1.9): no map literals, one statement per line, no backslashes in strings.
## Terms: upstream document = document of the link targets (e.g. customer specification), downstream document =
## document of the link sources. Verified for "satisfies" on 2512 (spike C3). Edge "up>down": o = upstream, c = downstream.
#set($bwVersion = "0.1.0")
